#: ../../library/rp2.Flash.rst:5
msgid "class Flash -- access to built-in flash storage"
msgstr "class Flash -- åtkomst till inbyggt flashminne"

#: ../../library/rp2.Flash.rst:7
msgid ""
"The :class:`Flash` class provides direct, block-level access to the RP2040's"
" external QSPI flash chip. The driver implements the "
":class:`vfs.AbstractBlockDev` interface so it can be passed to "
":func:`vfs.mount` for custom filesystem configurations."
msgstr ""
"Klassen :class:`Flash` ger direkt åtkomst på blocknivå till RP2040:s externa"
" QSPI-flashchip. Drivrutinen implementerar gränssnittet "
":class:`vfs.AbstractBlockDev` så att den kan skickas till :func:`vfs.mount` "
"för anpassade filsystemskonfigurationer."

#: ../../library/rp2.Flash.rst:12
msgid ""
"Most scripts persist data through the auto-mounted filesystem at ``/`` and "
"never construct :class:`Flash` directly. Construct one manually when you "
"need to:"
msgstr ""
"De flesta skript lagrar data via det automatiskt monterade filsystemet vid "
"``/`` och konstruerar aldrig :class:`Flash` direkt. Konstruera ett manuellt "
"när du behöver:"

#: ../../library/rp2.Flash.rst:16
msgid ""
"Mount a non-default filesystem (e.g. wrap with :class:`vfs.VfsFat`) on a "
"custom partition."
msgstr ""
"Montera ett filsystem som inte är standard (t.ex. omslutet av "
":class:`vfs.VfsFat`\\ ) på en anpassad partition."

#: ../../library/rp2.Flash.rst:18
msgid ""
"Read or write firmware regions or factory-data blocks that aren't owned by "
"the filesystem."
msgstr ""
"Läsa eller skriva firmware-regioner eller fabriksdatablock som inte ägs av "
"filsystemet."

#: ../../library/rp2.Flash.rst:20
msgid ""
"Implement a custom on-flash storage format that bypasses the filesystem "
"layer."
msgstr ""
"Implementera ett anpassat lagringsformat på flashminnet som kringgår "
"filsystemslagret."

#: ../../library/rp2.Flash.rst:24
msgid "Constructors"
msgstr "Konstruktorer"

#: ../../library/rp2.Flash.rst:28
msgid ""
"Return the singleton :class:`Flash` block-device object backed by the "
"RP2040's QSPI flash chip. The first block exposed is the one immediately "
"after the firmware region, so callers see only the filesystem-eligible area "
"of the chip."
msgstr ""
"Returnerar singleton-blockenhetsobjektet :class:`Flash` som backas av "
"RP2040:s QSPI-flashchip. Det första blocket som exponeras är det som ligger "
"omedelbart efter firmware-regionen, så anropare ser endast den del av chipet"
" som är tillgänglig för filsystemet."

#: ../../library/rp2.Flash.rst:34
msgid "Methods"
msgstr "Metoder"

#: ../../library/rp2.Flash.rst:39
msgid ""
"Read bytes from the flash into ``buf``. Standard "
":class:`vfs.AbstractBlockDev` block-device entry point used by the "
"filesystem layer."
msgstr ""
"Läser byte från flashminnet in i ``buf``\\ . Standardingång för blockenheter"
" enligt :class:`vfs.AbstractBlockDev` som används av filsystemslagret."

#: ../../library/rp2.Flash.rst:43
msgid ""
"**Simple form** (``readblocks(block_num, buf)``): read whole blocks starting"
" at block index ``block_num``. ``len(buf)`` must be a multiple of the flash "
"block size."
msgstr ""
"**Enkel form** (\\ ``readblocks(block_num, buf)``\\ ): läser hela block med "
"start vid blockindex ``block_num``\\ . ``len(buf)`` måste vara en multipel "
"av flashblockstorleken."

#: ../../library/rp2.Flash.rst:47
msgid ""
"**Extended form** (``readblocks(block_num, buf, offset)``): read "
"``len(buf)`` bytes -- not necessarily a whole number of blocks -- starting "
"at byte ``offset`` within block ``block_num``. Used by littlefs and other "
"byte-addressable filesystems."
msgstr ""
"**Utökad form** (\\ ``readblocks(block_num, buf, offset)``\\ ): läser "
"``len(buf)`` byte -- inte nödvändigtvis ett helt antal block -- med start "
"vid byte ``offset`` inom block ``block_num``\\ . Används av littlefs och "
"andra byteadresserbara filsystem."

#: ../../library/rp2.Flash.rst:56
msgid ""
"Write bytes from ``buf`` to the flash. Standard "
":class:`vfs.AbstractBlockDev` block-device entry point used by the "
"filesystem layer."
msgstr ""
"Skriver byte från ``buf`` till flashminnet. Standardingång för blockenheter "
"enligt :class:`vfs.AbstractBlockDev` som används av filsystemslagret."

#: ../../library/rp2.Flash.rst:60
msgid ""
"**Simple form** (``writeblocks(block_num, buf)``): write whole blocks "
"starting at block index ``block_num``. ``len(buf)`` must be a multiple of "
"the flash block size. Each affected block is erased automatically before "
"being written."
msgstr ""
"**Enkel form** (\\ ``writeblocks(block_num, buf)``\\ ): skriver hela block "
"med start vid blockindex ``block_num``\\ . ``len(buf)`` måste vara en "
"multipel av flashblockstorleken. Varje berört block raderas automatiskt "
"innan det skrivs."

#: ../../library/rp2.Flash.rst:66
msgid ""
"**Extended form** (``writeblocks(block_num, buf, offset)``): write "
"``len(buf)`` bytes -- not necessarily a whole number of blocks -- starting "
"at byte ``offset`` within block ``block_num``. **No implicit erase** is "
"performed -- the caller must ensure the affected blocks have been erased via"
" a prior ``ioctl(6, block_num)`` call."
msgstr ""
"**Utökad form** (\\ ``writeblocks(block_num, buf, offset)``\\ ): skriver "
"``len(buf)`` byte -- inte nödvändigtvis ett helt antal block -- med start "
"vid byte ``offset`` inom block ``block_num``\\ . **Ingen implicit radering**"
" utförs -- anroparen måste säkerställa att de berörda blocken har raderats "
"via ett föregående anrop till ``ioctl(6, block_num)``\\ ."

#: ../../library/rp2.Flash.rst:75
msgid ""
"Standard :class:`vfs.AbstractBlockDev` control entry point. Called by the "
"filesystem layer at mount/unmount time and on every sync. Recognised ``cmd``"
" values:"
msgstr ""
"Standardingång för styrning enligt :class:`vfs.AbstractBlockDev`\\ . Anropas"
" av filsystemslagret vid montering/avmontering och vid varje synkronisering."
" Igenkända ``cmd``\\ -värden:"

#: ../../library/rp2.Flash.rst:79
msgid "``1`` -- initialise. Returns ``0`` on success."
msgstr "``1`` -- initiera. Returnerar ``0`` vid lyckat resultat."

#: ../../library/rp2.Flash.rst:80
msgid "``2`` -- deinitialise. Returns ``0`` on success."
msgstr "``2`` -- avinitiera. Returnerar ``0`` vid lyckat resultat."

#: ../../library/rp2.Flash.rst:81
msgid "``3`` -- sync pending writes. Returns ``0``."
msgstr "``3`` -- synkronisera väntande skrivningar. Returnerar ``0``\\ ."

#: ../../library/rp2.Flash.rst:82
msgid "``4`` -- return the number of flash blocks visible to the filesystem."
msgstr "``4`` -- returnera antalet flashblock som är synliga för filsystemet."

#: ../../library/rp2.Flash.rst:84
msgid ""
"``5`` -- return the block size in bytes (typically the flash sector size, "
"``4096``)."
msgstr ""
"``5`` -- returnera blockstorleken i byte (vanligtvis flashsektorstorleken, "
"``4096``\\ )."

#: ../../library/rp2.Flash.rst:86
msgid ""
"``6`` -- erase the block at index ``arg``. Required before using the "
"extended ``writeblocks`` form."
msgstr ""
"``6`` -- radera blocket vid index ``arg``\\ . Krävs innan den utökade "
"``writeblocks``\\ -formen används."

#: ../../library/rp2.Flash.rst:88
msgid ""
"``7`` -- return whether the device supports the block erase command (``1`` "
"on RP2040)."
msgstr ""
"``7`` -- returnera huruvida enheten stöder blockraderingskommandot (\\ ``1``"
" på RP2040)."

#: ../../library/rp2.Flash.rst:91
msgid ""
"Direct callers normally don't use this method -- the filesystem driver "
"dispatches the standard codes automatically once the :class:`Flash` is "
"mounted."
msgstr ""
"Direkta anropare använder normalt inte denna metod -- filsystemsdrivrutinen "
"skickar standardkoderna automatiskt så snart :class:`Flash` är monterad."
